      },
      "message": "test(post): recorded streams carry the work offset as an index (#931)\n\nMain's recorded-stream guards (b471395e) build Dump { wcs: \"G54\" };\nDump::wcs is the 1-based index since this slice, so they build\nwcs: 1. The byte-for-byte stream guards then require the streams to\nread PARAM WorkOffset 1.000000, regenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1 on\nrecorded_streams and recorded_post_streams. Every posted golden is\nunchanged: offset 1 still posts each dialect's first-offset word.\n\nRefs #931\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
