      },
      "message": "test(post): recorded streams carry the work offset as an index (#931)\n\nMain's recorded-stream guards (#926) build Dump { wcs: \"G54\" }; this\nslice's dump writes the 1-based index, so the byte-for-byte stream\nguards need PARAM WorkOffset 1.000000. Only the stream files were\nregenerated (WRITE_GOLDEN=1 on recorded_streams and\nrecorded_post_streams); every script golden is byte-identical\n(offset 1 still posts each dialect's first-offset word).\n\nRefs #931\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
